# Paths chezmoi should leave entirely alone in the target.
#
# Listed here so chezmoi will not write, diff or remove them. Without this, a
# machine-local file sitting in a managed directory would either be reported as
# unmanaged drift or deleted as unknown.
#
# dot_zshrc sources this when it exists. It is the escape hatch that keeps
# .zshrc itself fully managed: machine-local shell configuration goes here
# rather than being typed into a file the repository owns.
.config/zsh/local.zsh
